  "prefLabel": "Fis 601.08 Total length",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-10-26",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 601.08 “Total length” means the straight-line distance from the tip of the snout to the tip of the tail or caudal fin while the fish is lying on its side, normally extended.\n\nSource. #5953, eff 1-25-95, EXPIRED: 1-25-03\n\nNew. #8087, eff 5-27-04; ss by #9805, eff 10-26-10, EXPIRED: 10-26-18\n\nNew. #12652, eff 10-27-18",
